  (text "GMA MATCH BOARD - bench breakout of the audio board's ADAU1372 <-> GMA 245R matching networks (2026-11-13).\nRefdes, values and footprints carried over from kicad/audio-board. K1 (U10/U11 AQW612S) and the failsafe electret are omitted:\nPV_OUT is wired straight to MIC_HI and PV_RTN straight to MIC_LO.\nTX: ADAU1372 HPOUTL+/- -> J1.1/J1.2 -> T4 SM-LP-5001 -> R10 10k -> C37 220nF film -> MIC_HI / MIC_LO (J5, J2).\nRX: EAR_HI / EAR_RTN (J5, J2) -> T2 + T3 SP-74 primaries in parallel -> T2 sec -> R7/R8 -> COMMS_TAP -> C27 -> AIN1 (J1.4).\nJ1.6 +3V3A is D1's clamp rail only: take it from the codec's AVDD. Aircraft-side nets never touch GND, except SPK_L_B via R9 0R."
    (at 119.38 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)))
    (uuid "73e12015-1e6c-4e59-9ec0-0904ebfc887d")
  )
	(symbol
		(lib_id "Connector_Generic:Conn_01x08")
